sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Calling service (e.g. CaseService)
    participant S as NotificationService
    participant E as IEmailService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    F->>S: NotifyAsync(accountId, title, message, redirectUrl)
    S->>R: Notification preferences of the account
    R->>DB: SELECT NOTIFICATIONPREFERENCES
    opt in-app channel on (no row counts as on)
        S->>R: CreateAsync(Notification, isRead = false)
        R->>DB: INSERT NOTIFICATIONS
    end
    opt email channel on
        S->>R: Account email
        S->>E: SendNotificationEmailAsync(email, fullName, title, message, redirectUrl)
    end
    S-->>F: done
